## Orchestrator integration

- A validation failure becomes a tool result (not a thrown error), so the orchestrator delivers the rejection text to the model and the model can attempt a corrected call; `DEFAULT_MAX_TOOL_ROUNDS = 5` is the bound that stops a retry cycle from spinning ([validated by: resolves processMessage and makes the validation-rejection text visible to the provider on the next round](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L677)).
